      "title": "NIS2 and the Dutch Cybersecurity Act (supplier view)",
      "note": "Indicative mapping of the Article 21(2) measures that a software supplier's development practice can evidence. NIS2 applies to the operator, not to the product; this view exists because an essential or important entity must manage supply-chain risk and will ask its suppliers for exactly this.",
